# Creating levels

When asked to create or substantially change a level, read `docs/level-authoring.md` for the scene structure, then follow `docs/level-creation-for-agents.md`. Tools are in `tools/level_gen`.

Never report a level as working from logic checks alone: test it in the running game, check what is on screen, look at the screenshots, and say what still needs a person to play it.
